  triage:title "storage_and_nudge_router.rs test still uses the sync-reserve/drop/reuse TOCTOU port pattern FTQ-001 fixed elsewhere" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-http-runtime/src/storage_and_nudge_router.rs:837-840 (test uds_runtime_reaches_the_canonical_storage_and_received_hook_path) still binds a TcpListener to reserve a port, reads its port number, then drops the listener and reuses the bare port number later -- the same TOCTOU pattern FTQ-001-AL6 fixed via port-0 passthrough elsewhere in lib.rs. Confirmed via a full workspace grep for TcpListener::bind(...)+drop(listener) that this is the only remaining occurrence." ;
